# YOLOv8-OBB weights: pretrained net auto-downloaded by ultralytics on the
# first Pass A run (canonical cache: ~/.cache/at-detection-prep/). A bare-name
# download can also land in the cwd, so never commit model weights — they are
# fetched artifacts, not source.
